{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "backend": "opencode",
  "description": "`/new` in a live opencode pane mints a fresh ses_ id and the plugin reports it as session.created. That is a CLI-reported rollover in the same sense as Claude's SessionStart, which is why the descriptor sets reports_conversation_rollover. There is no filesystem transcript-switch heuristic here for that flag to suppress - opencode keeps conversations as rows in opencode.db.",
  "steps": [
